    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d531">

                <pb facs="0536" n="364" xml:id="pg364"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72111/6754</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Mexico</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Fletcher</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Mexico City</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-11-08T17:00:00-06:36">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">November 8, 1917, 5 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received November 9, 12.85
                        a.m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>552. Note of the Argentine Minister here to the Mexican Government, fixing the
                    date of the Latin-American conference of neutrals to be held at Buenos Aires for
                    the first fortnight of January next, has been published with statement that
                    Mexican Government has decided to be represented thereat.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Fletcher</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
